    "identifier": "monkey-kings-cunning",
    "description": "<p>You spin your weapon around in a series of distracting twirls before you strike your targets arm and leg joints disabling their mobility and striking power.</p>\n<p>Make two melee taijutsu attacks using your weapon, dealing your weapons damage + 1d12. Affected creatures must make a Constitution saving throw. On a failed save they gain a rank of Weakened.</p>\n<p>Chain 1: Affected creature is also pushed 10 feet, in a direction of your choice, except upwards.</p>\n<p>Chain 2: A creature who failed their saving throw gain an additional rank of Weakened.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above C-Rank increase the cost of this jutsu by 3, the damage by 1d12.</p>",
